the required conduit and wire sizes.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
]</SPT><SPT><TTL>MAINTENANCE</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<SPT><TTL>Additions to Operation and Maintenance Data</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>In addition to requirements of Data Package 5, include the following on the actual primary unit substations provided.</TXT><BRK/>
<OLG><BRK/>
<OLI>An instruction manual with pertinent items and information highlighted</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>An outline drawing, including front view and sectional views with items and devices identified</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Prices for spare parts and supply list</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Routine and field acceptance test reports</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Time-Current-Characteristic (TCC) curves of fuses[ and circuit breakers]</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
[<OLI>Information on metering</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
]<OLI>Actual nameplate diagram</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
