<OLI LEVEL="2">Perform ratio-verification tests.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI LEVEL="2">Perform excitation test on transformers used for relaying applications.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI LEVEL="2">Measure circuit burden at transformer terminals and determine the total burden.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI LEVEL="2">When applicable, perform insulation resistance and dielectric withstand tests on the primary winding with secondary grounded.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI LEVEL="2">CAUTION:  Changes of connection, insertion, and removal of instruments, relays, and meters must be performed in such a manner 
that the secondary circuits of energized current transformers are not opened momentarily.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Electrical Tests - Voltage (Potential) Transformers</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI LEVEL="2">Perform insulation-resistance tests.</OLI><BRK/>
